      "name": "ProcessTileComponent",
      "signature": "undefined ProcessTileComponent(int param_1)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Processes a tile component by decompressing RLE-encoded texture data and uploading to Glide texture memory.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate cache index is non-negative (assert if negative)\n2. If cache index indicates unallocated (-1 branch):\n   a. Clear 256 DWORDs in decompression buffer (g_pTileDecompBuffer)\n   b. Decompress RLE data: read skip/copy pairs, copy bytes to buffer\n   c. Process 32 rows of 32 bytes each (0x20 iterations)\n   d. Allocate new cache slot via RotateQueueNode\n   e. Validate allocated slot is in valid range [0, g_nTileCacheMaxCount)\n   f. Store tile component pointer in cache array (g_pTileCacheArray)\n   g. Upload mipmap texture via grTexDownloadMipMap\n3. If cache already allocated:\n   a. Rotate existing cache entry to mark as recently used\n   b. Load existing texture handle from cache\n4. Set texture source via grTexSource\n5. Call InsertSubtile to finalize tile rendering\n\nParameters:\n  pTileComp - TileComponent* passed in ECX (__fastcall). Contains:\n              - nCacheIndex at offset 0x4: texture cache slot index (-1 if unallocated)\n              - pCompressedData at offset 0x10: RLE-compressed texture data pointer\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value. Side effects: texture uploaded to Glide, cache updated.\n\nRLE Decompression Format:\n  Each row encoded as pairs: [skip_count][copy_count][data_bytes...]\n  skip_count = 0 and copy_count = 0 indicates end of row (advance to next)\n  Buffer is 32x32 bytes (1024 bytes total, cleared as 256 DWORDs)\n\nGlobal References:\n  g_pTileDecompBuffer (0x6f884e08) - 1024-byte tile decompression buffer\n  g_pTileCacheArray (0x6f88536c) - Array of cached tile entries (20 bytes each)\n  g_nTileCacheMaxCount (0x6f885354) - Maximum cache slot count for bounds check\n\nCalled By: RenderTileRow, ProcessTileProjectRendering, RenderTileIsometric, \n           RenderTileProjected, RenderTileProjectComponents",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.09d",
