      "name": "InitializeGlideDisplay",
      "signature": "undefined4 InitializeGlideDisplay(undefined4 param_1, int param_2)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Initializes Glide graphics display with specified dimensions\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Close existing Glide window if open\n  2. Shutdown current Glide graphics context\n  3. Initialize new Glide graphics system\n  4. Select Glide SST device\n  5. Initialize Glide window with specified width/height\n  6. Clear frame buffer to black (0, 0, 0) if initialization succeeds\n  7. Swap frame buffer based on graphics configuration flag\n\nParameters:\n  dwWidth (DWORD): Display width in pixels, passed via EDX register\n  nHeight (int): Display height in pixels, passed via ECX register\n\nReturns:\n  1: Display initialized successfully and buffer swap complete\n  0: InitializeGlideWindowInternal failed, no buffer operations performed\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  Checks g_pGraphicsConfig[0x10] to determine double-buffer vs single-buffer swap",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:0855ee495b06c0ebec8c1ae390606379e8ef5c80c875b7a38bcdf1c449ca368e",
