      "name": "SetTextureCombineState",
      "signature": "undefined SetTextureCombineState(int param_1)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Sets the texture combining state for Glide rendering\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Load current texture combine mode from global state\n  2. If new mode equals current mode, exit early\n  3. If mode is 1 (additive blend): call grTexCombine(0,3,8,3,8,0,0)\n  4. If mode is 0 (normal blend): call grTexCombine(0,1,0,1,0,0,0)\n  5. Store new mode in global state\n  6. Return\n\nParameters:\n  nTextureMode (int, ECX): Texture combine mode\n    0 = Normal blend (1x source)\n    1 = Additive blend (3x source)\n\nReturns:\n  void - Updates global g_dwCurrentTextureCombineMode and calls Glide API\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If same mode is requested, no grTexCombine call is made (optimization)\n  - Only two valid modes are handled; invalid modes default to update globals\n  - This function is called by tile processing and component rendering",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:45c1eff6f15c659742beb8f58ece633a13b979ae9a5b22df7bfb701949201de7",
