      "name": "DrawColorPatternTestGrid",
      "signature": "undefined DrawColorPatternTestGrid(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Draws a 48x48 (0x30 x 0x30) color pattern test grid using Glide 3D point rendering.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Set color combine mode to constant color (mode 1) and disable chromakey\n  2. Iterate through 48 rows (nRowIndex: 0 to 0x2F)\n  3. For each row, iterate through 48 columns (nColIndex: 0 to 0x2F)\n  4. Calculate Y base position: nRowIndex + 0x32 (50)\n  5. Calculate X adjustment: nRowIndex * -2 (diagonal offset)\n  6. Special case: At center cell (0x18, 0x18), draw 8 black points\n  7. Normal case: Look up color pattern from g_pColorPatternTable\n     - Extract alpha (byte at offset +4 in 8-byte color entry)\n     - Extract RGB components (bytes at offsets +5, +6, +7)\n     - Blend RGB with alpha and pack into ARGB format\n  8. Draw 8 points per cell using X/Y offset arrays (g_aPointXOffsets, g_aPointYOffsets)\n     - X coordinate: g_aPointXOffsets[i] + nColIndex*2 + 100 + nXAdjust\n     - Y coordinate: g_aPointYOffsets[i] + (nYBase + nColIndex)*2\n  9. Restore color combine mode (mode 3) and enable chromakey\n\nParameters:\n  None (void)\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Center cell (row 0x18, col 0x18) draws 8 black points instead of pattern colors\n\nStructure Layout (Color Pattern Entry - 8 bytes per column):\n  Offset | Size | Field | Type  | Description\n  -------+------+-------+-------+------------------------\n  0x00   | 4    | -     | -     | (unknown/padding)\n  0x04   | 1    | Alpha | byte  | Alpha/intensity value\n  0x05   | 1    | Red   | byte  | Red component\n  0x06   | 1    | Green | byte  | Green component  \n  0x07   | 1    | Blue  | byte  | Blue component",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:555d1d45085f22093cde8861283235b722751e29e7c7242baede679828a5ea58",
