      "name": "TouchCacheItem",
      "signature": "undefined TouchCacheItem(int param_1, int param_2)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Moves a cache item to the tail of the used list (LRU touch operation).\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Early exit if cache has <= 1 items (nothing to reorder)\n  2. Validate nIndex: must be != 0 (INVALID_HARDWARE_ADDRESS), \n     <= nMaxNumItems, and >= 1\n  3. Compute target item pointer: pItems + (nIndex - 1)\n     Item array is 0x14 (20) bytes per entry\n  4. Unlink target item from current position:\n     a. If target is head: advance head to next, clear backlinks\n     b. If target is tail: move tail to previous item\n     c. Otherwise: standard doubly-linked list removal\n  5. Append target item to tail of used list:\n     a. If list empty: set both head and tail to target\n     b. Otherwise: link after current tail, update tail pointer\n\nParameters:\n  pCache (ECX)  Pointer to TextureCache structure\n  nIndex (EDX)  1-based index into cache item array\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nStructure Layout - TextureCache (32 bytes):\n  Offset | Size | Field        | Type              | Description\n  0x00   | 4    | dwUnknown_00 | uint              | Unknown\n  0x04   | 4    | nMaxNumItems | int               | Maximum items capacity\n  0x08   | 4    | nNumItems    | int               | Current item count\n  0x0C   | 4    | pUsedHead    | TextureCacheItem* | Head of used list\n  0x10   | 4    | pUsedTail    | TextureCacheItem* | Tail of used list (MRU)\n  0x14   | 4    | pFreeHead    | TextureCacheItem* | Head of free list\n  0x18   | 4    | pFreeTail    | TextureCacheItem* | Tail of free list\n  0x1C   | 4    | pItems       | TextureCacheItem* | Item array base\n\nStructure Layout - TextureCacheItem (20 bytes):\n  Offset | Size | Field        | Type              | Description\n  0x00   | 4    | dwUnknown_00 | uint              | Unknown data\n  0x04   | 4    | dwUnknown_04 | uint              | Unknown data\n  0x08   | 4    | dwUnknown_08 | uint              | Unknown data\n  0x0C   | 4    | pNext        | TextureCacheItem* | Next item in list\n  0x10   | 4    | pPrev        | TextureCacheItem* | Previous item in list",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
