      "name": "InitializeSpriteRenderingBuffers",
      "signature": "undefined InitializeSpriteRenderingBuffers(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Initializes sprite rendering pipeline buffers\nAllocates and clears three sprite rendering buffers for the graphics pipeline\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Initialize sprite index counters to 0xFFFFFFFF (invalid/reset state)\n     - g_dwSpriteIndexCurrent (0x6f886cf0)\n     - g_dwSpriteIndexMax (0x6f886d0c)\n     - g_dwSpriteIndexReserved (0x6f886d28)\n     - g_dwSpriteIndexFlags (0x6f886d44)\n  2. Allocate 0x8000 (32KB) buffer for sprite buffer 0 (line 0x47)\n  3. Allocate 0x8000 (32KB) buffer for sprite buffer 1 (line 0x48)\n  4. Allocate 0x8000 (32KB) buffer for sprite buffer 2 (line 0x49)\n\nParameters:\n  None\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - All three buffers are 32KB in size\n  - Initialized from source file D2Gli\n  - Uses FogMemAlloc for memory allocation with debug line info",
