      "name": "FreeTileCacheBuffers",
      "signature": "undefined FreeTileCacheBuffers(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Releases tile cache memory buffers allocated for texture rendering.\n\n  Algorithm:\n  1. Check if tile component cache buffer (0x400 bytes) is allocated\n  2. If allocated, release via pool ID 0x3f (63) and clear pointer\n  3. Check if floor tile cache buffer (0x8000 bytes) is allocated\n  4. If allocated, release via pool ID 0x45 (69) and clear pointer\n\n  Parameters:\n  None\n\n  Returns:\n  void\n\n  Special Cases:\n  - Safe to call if buffers already freed (NULL checks prevent double-free)\n  - Called during D2Gfx shutdown to clean up tile rendering resources\n\n  Related Globals:\n  Offset      Size  Name                         Description\n  6f884e08    4     g_pTileComponentCacheBuffer  32x32 tile component staging (0x400 bytes)\n  6f884e0c    4     g_pFloorTileCacheBuffer      Floor tile texture staging (0x8000 bytes)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.01",
