      "name": "InitializeGlideTextureManager",
      "signature": "void InitializeGlideTextureManager(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Allocates and initializes a 32KB buffer for Glide texture management.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Allocate 0x8000 (32768) bytes via FogMemAlloc\n  2. Store pointer to g_pvGlideTextureBuffer global\n\nParameters:\n  None\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Allocation failure would result in g_pvGlideTextureBuffer = NULL\n  - Buffer is statically allocated once at initialization\n  - Used for managing Glide 3D rendering textures",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
