      "name": "InitializeFogColorTable",
      "signature": "undefined InitializeFogColorTable(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Initializes the fog effect color table by pre-computing fog intensity values.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Iterate through 256 (0x100) palette entries\n  2. For each palette entry, iterate through 256 color values\n  3. Compute fog effect intensity using magic number 0x80808081\n  4. Store computed fog-modified color in palette table\n\nParameters:\n  None\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Uses 0x80808081 magic multiplier for color intensity computation\n  - Fills g_pColorPalette with pre-computed fog effect values (256x256 table)\n  - Optimizes runtime fog rendering by pre-calculating color transitions",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:8fa2588cb3a9173d27b9d83e733bb47706cb84e7b24c76579d3446a2770d80a8",
