      "name": "ValidateAndEnumerateLocales",
      "signature": "undefined ValidateAndEnumerateLocales(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Validates country code length and enumerates system locales.\n\n  Algorithm:\n  1. Get length of global country code string (g_szCountryCode)\n  2. Set g_bCountryIs3Char flag based on length == 3 (0x3)\n  3. Enumerate all system locales using EnumSystemLocalesA callback\n  4. If bit 0x4 not set in g_dwLocaleValidation, clear the flag\n\n  Parameters: None\n\n  Returns: None (void)\n\n  Special Cases:\n  - Uses STDCALL calling convention\n  - Operates on global state (country code, locale flags)\n  - Callback FUN_00409a24 handles locale enumeration",
