      "name": "HandleGlideExtensionQuery",
      "signature": "undefined4 HandleGlideExtensionQuery(int param_1, undefined4 * param_2)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Handles Glide extension queries for gamma and graphics state.\n\n  Algorithm:\n    1. Subtract 0x0A (10) from opcode in ECX\n    2. If result is zero (opcode = 0x0A): Read g_dwGraphicsInitialized into [pData], return 1\n    3. Decrement result (checking for opcode = 0x0B)\n    4. If result is zero (opcode = 0x0B): Write pData to g_dwGammaLevel, return 1\n    5. Otherwise: Return 0 (unsupported opcode)\n\n  Parameters:\n    nOpcode (ECX): Extension opcode\n      - 0x0A (10): Get graphics initialized state\n      - 0x0B (11): Set gamma correction level\n    pData (EDX): Pointer to data buffer for get/set operations\n\n  Returns:\n    1 - Success (opcode handled)\n    0 - Failure (unsupported opcode)\n\n  Special Cases:\n    - Only opcodes 0x0A and 0x0B are supported\n    - Part of Glide extension callback table at 0x6f881060",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.04b",
      "method": "NOP",
