      "name": "InitializeGlideResources",
      "signature": "undefined InitializeGlideResources(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Initialize Glide graphics resources for rendering.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Check if decompression buffer already allocated (0x10000 bytes)\n  2. If allocated, assert and clean up using FUN_6f878859\n  3. Check if highlight buffer already allocated (0x10000 bytes)\n  4. If allocated, assert and clean up using FUN_6f878859\n  5. Allocate decompression buffer (0x10000 bytes)\n  6. Allocate highlight buffer (0x10000 bytes)\n  7. Register celfile callback handler (FUN_6f875070)\n  8. Initialize fullscreen mode flag to false (0x0)\n  9. Check if TMU count > 1 (multi-texture support)\n  10. If multi-TMU available, query fullscreen mode and set flag\n  \nParameters:\n  None\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Called during Glide window initialization\n  - Allocates fixed-size buffers (64KB each) for graphics operations\n  - Fullscreen mode detection only applies if multi-TMU support present",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.09d",
