      "name": "TransformGlideTextureCoordinates",
      "signature": "void TransformGlideTextureCoordinates(int nTextureDataOffset, int nTextureSizeOffset, uint dwReserved, int * pScreenX, int * pScreenY, int nApplyOffset)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Transform Glide texture coordinates to screen space coordinates\n  \n  Algorithm:\n    1. Scale texture data offset relative to global base (multiply by 0x18, shift right 0x10)\n    2. Scale texture size offset relative to global base using same factors\n    3. Compute sum of scaled offsets\n    4. Calculate vertical scaling factor (multiply by 0x5a800 negated, shift right 10)\n    5. Calculate cache index (multiply by 0x9c9b8, shift right 0x14, mask with 0x1fff)\n    6. Lookup cache value at primary index offset (index - 0x1000) & 0x1fff\n    7. Compute screen X as (offset_delta * cache_value * 0x2d4 >> 0x14) + g_dwScreenWidth / 2\n    8. Compute screen Y as (cache_value * vertical_scale >> 0x14) + g_dwScreenHeight / 2 - 0x10\n    9. Lookup cache value at secondary index offset (index - 0xf80) & 0x1fff\n    10. Calculate final offset by subtracting secondary cache contribution from screen Y offset\n    11. Apply scaling to final offset (0x4cc if nApplyOffset != 0, else 0x466), store in g_dwGlideTextureCacheSize\n\n  Parameters:\n    nTextureDataOffset [ECX]: Texture data offset from global g_dwGlideTextureData\n    nTextureSizeOffset [EDX]: Texture size offset from global g_dwGlideTextureSize\n    dwReserved [EBX]: Reserved/unused parameter\n    pScreenX [ESP+8]: Output pointer for screen X coordinate\n    pScreenY [ESP+12]: Output pointer for screen Y coordinate\n    nApplyOffset [ESP+16]: Scaling mode (0=use 0x466, non-zero=use 0x4cc)\n\n  Returns:\n    void; modifies *pScreenX and *pScreenY with transformed screen coordinates\n          and updates global g_dwGlideTextureCacheSize with computed scale value",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:41290f3bfc8e915d078f12c7742570742504468d4f0f6a7bf120ed962aaa1d50",
