      "name": "LoadAndDrawCelTexture",
      "signature": "int LoadAndDrawCelTexture(CelFile * pCelFile, uint dwTextureCacheId, byte bHighlightByte, int nTierParam)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Loads CEL frame texture into cache and uploads to graphics hardware for rendering.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pCelFile->pCelData is non-null, assert fatal error if null\n2. Retrieve skill data for frame index via GetSkillData\n3. Normalize nTierParam: value 4 maps to tier 1\n4. Determine texture quality tier based on pixel count:\n   - Pixels < 0x1001 (4097): Tier 3 (high quality)\n   - Pixels < 0x4001 (16385): Tier 2 (medium quality)\n   - Pixels < 0x10000 (65536): Tier 1 (low quality)\n   - Pixels >= 0x10000: Return 0 (texture too large)\n5. Check if texture already cached and valid by cache ID\n6. If texture not cached or cache ID mismatch:\n   a. Allocate new cache slot via TextureCacheMoveToFront\n   b. Store cache metadata (skill data ptr, tier index, cache ID)\n   c. Clear decompression buffer with memset zero\n   d. Decode frame via D2CMP_DecodeAndDrawCelFrame based on tier\n   e. Tier 2: Apply palette remapping for transparency\n   f. Tier 3: Clear highlight buffer, apply edge highlighting\n   g. Upload texture via grTexDownloadMipMap\n7. If texture cached: Call RemoveNodeFromCache to refresh LRU\n8. Set texture source and combine state for rendering\n9. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n  pCelFile [ECX] - Pointer to CelFile structure with frame data\n  dwTextureCacheId [EDX] - Unique cache identifier for texture\n  bHighlightByte [Stack+4] - Highlight color byte for edge pixels (tier 3)\n  nTierParam [Stack+8] - Texture tier override (4 normalizes to 1)\n\nReturns:\n  1 - Success, texture loaded and ready for rendering\n  0 - Failure, texture dimensions exceed 65536 pixels\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x1001 - Tier 3/2 pixel threshold (4097)\n  0x4001 - Tier 2/1 pixel threshold (16385)\n  0x10000 - Maximum texture size (65536 pixels)\n  0x12d, 0x184, 0x185, 0x1ad, 0x1ae - Assert line numbers\n\nGlobals Accessed:\n  g_pDecompressionBuffer - Texture decompression workspace\n  g_pHighlightBuffer - Edge highlight buffer (tier 3)\n  g_bUseFullscreenMode - Fullscreen mode flag\n  g_bMultiTmuSupport - Multi-TMU texture support\n  g_pPaletteData - Palette remapping table",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
