      "name": "DrawCelTextureScaled",
      "signature": "undefined DrawCelTextureScaled(int * param_1, int param_2, int param_3)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Draws a Cel (sprite frame) as a scaled textured quad using Glide 3D API.\n\n  Algorithm:\n    1. Load or retrieve Cel frame data from cache via LoadOrRetrieveCelFrameData\n    2. Validate CelFileInfo pointer; assert and fallback if NULL\n    3. Extract Cel dimensions: table index, height, mode, and frame height\n    4. Calculate texture dimensions via CalculateTextureDimensions\n    5. Load texture via LoadAndDrawCelTexture\n    6. Configure rendering state:\n       - Enable color combine mode (1)\n       - Set alpha blend mode (1=normal or 4=with constant alpha 0xC0 (192))\n       - Enable texture filtering mode (1)\n    7. Calculate scaled texture coordinates using g_aScaleFactorsU/V arrays\n    8. Handle resolution scaling if background color set and cache size != 0x100 (256)\n    9. Build 4-vertex quad in g_aVertexArray with:\n       - Screen positions (X1-X4, Y1-Y4)\n       - Texture coordinates (U1-U4, V1-V4)\n       - Alpha values (all 1.0f = 0x3F800000)\n       - Z values (all 0)\n    10. Draw quad via grDrawVertexArrayContiguous(GR_TRIANGLE_FAN=5, 4 vertices, stride=0x1C (28))\n\n  Parameters:\n    ppCelContext (ECX) - Pointer to CelFileInfo pointer (Cel animation context)\n    pPositionData (EDX) - Pointer to position/offset data (unused directly, stored in stack)\n\n  Returns:\n    void - Draws directly to Glide framebuffer\n\n  Special Cases:\n    - Early exit if LoadOrRetrieveCelFrameData returns 0 (load failure)\n    - Early exit if LoadAndDrawCelTexture returns 0 (texture load failure)\n    - If ppCelContext->hCel is NULL, triggers FogAssert at line 0xCE (206)\n    - Resolution scaling applied when g_dwGlideTextureCacheSize != 0x100 (256)\n\n  Structure Layout (CelFile at Stack[-0x3C]):\n    Offset | Size | Field        | Type   | Description\n    0x00   | 4    | pCelData     | void*  | Pointer to cel/position data\n    0x04   | 4    | pHeader      | void*  | Cel file table index\n    0x08   | 4    | nLeftOffset  | int    | Left edge offset (height value)\n    0x0C   | 4    | nTopOffset   | int    | Top edge offset (mode value)\n    0x10   | 4    | nFrameHeight | int    | Frame height (DWORD field)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.08",
